The build failure came from the top-level `use` and `import` lines I had placed outside the world. WIT allows only `use ... as ...` at file scope, so the parser stopped at the `.` in the versioned path. Both now sit inside `world node`, and the `with` clause is unchanged: the node imports only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`.

I did not add `aap:caps/http-client` or the enrichment fetch. The node's grant is exactly `state-read`, and the request would send each item's text to an external host, which is outside that grant. Adding it would need the graph definition and grant to change first, not just this crate.

